'''Nemeses''' (戦国ライバル, ''Sengoku Raibaru'', '''Sengoku Rivals''') was a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Cat Base Defense UP (M): Cat Base health is increased by 50%.

