==Trivia==
*Nemeses was a reference to the real-life rivalry between [[wikipedia:Uesugi Kenshin|Uesugi Kenshin]] and [[wikipedia:Takeda Shingen|Takeda Shingen]], who fought [[wikipedia:Battles of Kawanakajima|five battles against each other]] from 1553 to 1564.

